<title>USA: Pomeroy Computer gets contracts.</title>
<headline>Pomeroy Computer gets contracts.</headline>
<dateline>HEBRON, Ky. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pomeroy Computer  Resources said Tuesday it received two  networking products contracts worth a combined estimated value of  $15 million over the upcoming fiscal year, one for a Kentucky-based  medical and health care provider and the other for a Tennessee-based regional banking organization.</p>
<p>The  company also announced today its receipt of a services contract with an Iowa-based insurance  company for an estimated value  of $0.5 million over the upcoming fiscal year.</p>
</text>
